-- group structure and actions
G1  (5.9) associativity (g1 g2) g3 = g1 (g2 g3)                                      holds
G1' inverse: g g^-1 = (1, 0)                                                         holds
G2  (5.10) right action: (A.g1).g2 = A.(g1 g2)                                       holds
